  "description": "Blush, burgundy and gold floral bouquets bridal templates clipart Watercolor pre-made wedding invitation templates. Geometric golden frames and floral decor elements collection clip art comes with 38 different design elements. You can use them to dress up your Party, invitations, clothing’s, cards, stickers, web design, floral wall decor, wedding decor, create gift, make tumbler or mug waterslide transfer, sublimation and scrapbooking project.\nAll vector objects can be resized without any quality loss, colors can be changed.\nThe pack includes the following design elements as you can see in the preview:\n8 floral frames\n8 golden wire frame\n6 watercolor floral bouquets\n6 watercolor floral bouquets with gold elements\n6 watercolor set flowers\n4 watercolor set greenery\nWith this purchase you will receive a package that contains the following files:\n38 PNG image in high-resolution with transparent, invisible backgrounds. You can place the individual clip art on any color or background you like. (promotion materials, T shirt…)\n38 JPG files\n38 SVG files\n1 Ai file (vector format)\n1 Corel Draw compatible EPS file\n1 Photoshop file with layered elements\n1 PDF file\nNo logo and paper texture will appear on purchased items.\nFiles are compatible for use with a variety of image editing, crafting programs.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Blush, burgundy and gold floral bouquets bridal templates clipart Watercolor pre-made wedding invitation templates. Geometric golden frames and floral decor elements collection clip art comes with 38 different design elements. You can use them to dress up your Party, invitations, clothing’s, cards, stickers, web design, floral wall decor, wedding decor, create gift, make tumbler or mug waterslide transfer, sublimation and scrapbooking project.</p>\n<p>All vector objects can be resized without any quality loss, colors can be changed.<br>\nThe pack includes the following design elements as you can see in the preview:<br>\n8 floral frames<br>\n8 golden wire frame<br>\n6 watercolor floral bouquets<br>\n6 watercolor floral bouquets with gold elements<br>\n6 watercolor set flowers<br>\n4 watercolor set greenery</p>\n<p>With this purchase you will receive a package that contains the following files:</p>\n<p>38 PNG image in high-resolution with transparent, invisible backgrounds. You can place the individual clip art on any color or background you like. (promotion materials, T shirt…)<br>\n38 JPG files<br>\n38 SVG files<br>\n1 Ai file (vector format)<br>\n1 Corel Draw compatible EPS file<br>\n1 Photoshop file with layered elements<br>\n1 PDF file</p>\n<p>No logo and paper texture will appear on purchased items.</p>\n<p>Files are compatible for use with a variety of image editing, crafting programs.</p>",
